*Alpha 3.0: New card: Heal. COMMON Spell. SOUL: Kindness. COST 2. EFFECT: Restore 5 HP.
**New players would start with Heal. ''(Beta 30.0 was when starter cards would receive the Base rarity.)''
*Beta 2.0: COST 2 > 1.
*Beta 5.2: COST 1 > 2. EFFECT UPDATE: Restore 3 HP. Draw a card.
**Mirroring the update to Heal, [[Poison]] gained 1 cost and "Draw a card."
*Beta 5.7: COST 2 > 0.
**Mirroring the updates to Heal, [[Protection]] gained "Draw a card," and Protection and [[Poison]] had COST 1 > 0.
*Beta 7.4: COST 0 > 1.
*Beta 10.2: COST 1 > 0.
*Beta 19.0: COST 0 > 1.
*Beta 21.0: EFFECT UPDATE: Restore 3 HP and remove negative effects. Draw a card.
**This effect is similar to that of [[Asriel]].
*Beta 24.0: EFFECT UPDATE: Restore 3 HP. Remove negative effects instead if there are any. Draw a card.
*Beta 25.0: EFFECT UPDATE: Restore 3 HP and remove negative effects. Draw a card if there are none.
*Beta 26.0: 
**[[Force of Nature]] took the place of Heal as [[:Category:Kindness|Kindness]]'s starter spell. ''(Beta 30.0 was when starter cards would receive the Base rarity.)''
*Beta 33.0: Updated sprite.
**[[Force of Nature]], [[Soothing]], [[Test of Will]] and [[Octofriend]] also received updated sprites.
*Beta 52.1: EFFECT UPDATE: Heal 3 HP. If this targeted you, draw a card. If this targeted a monster, remove negative effects from it.
*Beta 92.0: EFFECT UPDATE: Heal 3 HP. If this targeted a player, draw a card. If this targeted a monster, remove negative effects from it.
**This was a community requested wording change made by elytrafae.

